<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Vickers upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Vickers upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it raised its near-term rating on Vickers Plc to neutral from reduce.</p>
<p>-- Kept long term neutral rating.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
</text>
